{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の松本和子(まつもとわこ)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobrd0Wlq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single BACKS曲 「コインランドリー」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MUSIC VIDEOが公開されました🫧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ?si=FI4n1I95l_AEHI-9"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な作品になっています"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひご覧ください！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobAkpSdX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5MPPia.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "セットで世界観がすごく作り込まれていて、楽しく撮影をさせていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "衣装もとっても可愛くて！♡"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い衣装を纏った先輩方と沢山写真を撮れて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob2mSg5N.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobzFHdEz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobh3yqt4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobYRrVV1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobZwKajZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "増本さんにとって、櫻坂46としての最後の大切なシングルでシンメのポジションに立たせていただいております。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生が加入して間もない頃から、沢山話しかけてくださり、空気を和ませてくださる増本さんに、救われたことも多いです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつでも可愛くて、お話も上手で尊敬しています！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私では不釣り合いかもしれませんが、隣に堂々と立てるように、沢山のことを学ばせていただきたいです✨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobyZUEN6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobwIhF8R.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メリーゴーランドに乗せていただいてご満悦🎠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今まで撮影で笑顔で踊ることがあまり多くなかったので、ニコニコで踊っていて楽しかったです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15枚目シングル、よろしくお願いいたします！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobeHxMxP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}